      "en": "It will happen that if ten men remain in one house, they will die.",
      "ko": "한 집에 열 사람이 남는다 하여도 다 죽을 것이라",
      "source_text_hash": "97ff35c0bec367f77730b9bef05eacb141d0543826679eb40e42a0d482abbc24",
      "translation_text_hash": "7c176ecb7ba53f6d35948ed3038865d3d6d2c434df6017a3da36f27dac96f290",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
