      "en": "“For, behold, the LORD commands, and the great house will be smashed to pieces, and the little house into bits.",
      "ko": "보라 여호와께서 명하시므로 큰 집이 침을 받아 갈라지며 작은 집이 침을 받아 터지리라",
      "source_text_hash": "a157674b3416303e8e584c3e0cb1613360c5195296e933ba3764f4fe8251a163",
      "translation_text_hash": "37c4b8cf0b0f0f9ed7ffb269fde3ab594e89b2c4f980a9ea4c9cda8adafe89af",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
